THAN 15%.

00:32:09.880 --> 00:32:12.250
POST PANDEMIC HAS REVEALED
CHANGING MARKET TRENDS,

00:32:12.250 --> 00:32:13.870
SUCH AS LESS DEMAND FOR OFFICE
SPACE

00:32:13.870 --> 00:32:15.190
OR RISING COST OF CONSTRUCTION,

00:32:15.190 --> 00:32:17.290
LEADING DEVELOPERS TO REVISE
THE PROJECT

00:32:17.290 --> 00:32:19.690
AND MAKE ADJUSTMENTS TO COMPLETE
THE PROJECT.

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:21.430
