00:32:27.910 --> 00:32:29.170
INCLUDE MORE SQUARE FOOTAGE

00:32:29.170 --> 00:32:30.370
THAN THE MARKET CAN BEAR.

00:32:30.820 --> 00:32:33.280
AB 3122 MODIFIES THE 15% RULE

00:32:33.280 --> 00:32:35.650
IN SB 35 TO MAKE THE CAP ONLY

00:32:35.650 --> 00:32:37.000
