COMMISSION.

00:36:17.110 --> 00:36:18.489
GOVERNOR NEWSOM SIGNED MY BILL,

00:36:18.940 --> 00:36:22.180
AB 1307, INTO LAW IN 2022.

00:36:22.239 --> 00:36:24.280
THAT BILL CREATED THE RIVERSIDE
COUNTY

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:25.570
REDISTRICTING COMMISSION,

00:36:25.570 --> 00:36:27.400
WHICH IS EMPOWERED TO REDRAW

00:36:27.400 --> 00:36:29.110
DISTRICT DISTRICT BOUNDARIES

00:36:29.110 --> 00:36:31.210
FOR THE RIVERSIDE COUNTY BOARD
OF SUPERVISORS.

00:36:31.239 --> 00:36:33.460
THE COMMISSION WOULD FIRST BE
CONSTITUTED

00:36:33.460 --> 00:36:36.160
AFTER THE NEXT CENSUS IN 2030,

00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:38.500
AND WOULD BE RECONSTITUTED AFTER
EVERY

00:36:38.500 --> 00:36:40.270
DECENNIAL CENSUS THEREAFTER.

00:36:40.300 --> 00:36:42.820
THE INTRODUCTION OF 1307 REALLY
KICKED OFF

00:36:42.820 --> 00:36:45.250
THE CURRENT WAVE OF COUNTY
REDISTRICTING

00:36:45.250 --> 00:36:47.200
COMMITTEE BILLS THAT WE ARE
CURRENTLY

00:36:47.200 --> 00:36:48.969
SEEING IN RECENT YEARS.

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:50.830
THE COMMITTEE APPROVED
INDEPENDENT REDISTRICTING

00:36:50.830 --> 00:36:52.540
COMMISSIONS FOR FRESNO, KERN,

00:36:52.540 --> 00:36:55.210
ORANGE, AND SACRAMENTO COUNTIES,

00:36:55.210 --> 00:36:57.130
AND THE GOVERNOR SIGNED THOSE
BILLS INTO LAW.

00:36:57.160 --> 00:37:00.190
HOWEVER, AB 34 BY ASSEMBLY
MEMBER VALENCIA

00:37:00.190 --> 00:37:04.210
AND SB 314 BY SENATOR ASHBY
CONTAIN VERY USEFUL

00:37:04.210 --> 00:37:07.090
INNOVATIONS THAT NONE OF THE
PREVIOUS COUNTY

00:37:07.090 --> 00:37:09.010
REDISTRICTING COMMISSION BILLS
INCLUDED,

00:37:09.010 --> 00:37:10.390
AND BOTH OF THOSE BILLS WERE
SIGNED

00:37:10.390 --> 00:37:11.980
BY THE GOVERNOR LAST YEAR.

00:37:11.980 --> 00:37:14.560
SO THE PURPOSE OF 1807 IS TO
IMPORT

00:37:14.560 --> 00:37:15.880
MANY OF THOSE INNOVATIONS

00:37:15.880 --> 00:37:17.620
TO THE RIVERSIDE COUNTY CITIZENS

00:37:17.620 --> 00:37:18.850
REDISTRICTING COMMISSION.

00:37:18.850 --> 00:37:21.730
THIS INCLUDES UPDATING THE
REDISTRICTING CRITERIA

00:37:21.730 --> 00:37:23.710
TO REALLY REFLECT THE CHANGES
MADE

00:37:23.710 --> 00:37:27.760
BY THE ENACTMENT OF THE FAIR
MAPS ACT OF 2023,

00:37:27.910 --> 00:37:30.040
WHICH I WAS A PROUD AUTHOR OF.

00:37:30.040 --> 00:37:34.360
AB 1807 WOULD ALSO IMPOSE
STRONGER PROHIBITIONS ON

00:37:34.360 --> 00:37:37.000
THE ABILITY OF COMMISSIONERS TO
HAVE COMMUNICATIONS

00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:39.370
ABOUT REDISTRICTING ISSUES
OUTSIDE OF

00:37:39.370 --> 00:37:41.650
THE PUBLIC MEETING OF THE
COMMISSION.

00:37:41.680 --> 00:37:43.360
THE BILL WOULD ALSO REQUIRE

00:37:43.360 --> 00:37:44.560
THE COMMISSION TO TRANSLATE

00:37:44.560 --> 00:37:46.480
BOTH ON ITS WEBSITE AND MANY

00:37:46.480 --> 00:37:47.770
OF THE WRITTEN MATERIALS

00:37:47.770 --> 00:37:49.390
IT DISTRIBUTES INTO LANGUAGES

00:37:49.390 --> 00:37:51.489
SPOKEN BY AT LEAST 3% OF

00:37:51.489 --> 00:37:54.580
THE TOTAL VOTING AGE RESIDENTS
OF RIVERSIDE COUNTY.

00:37:54.760 --> 00:37:57.070
THE BILL WOULD ALSO IMPOSE MORE
RESTRICTIONS

00:37:57.070 --> 00:37:58.780
ON THE ACTIVITIES OF
COMMISSIONERS.

00:37:58.780 --> 00:38:01.060
FOR INSTANCE, THREE YEARS AFTER
BEING

00:38:01.060 --> 00:38:02.980
APPOINTED TO THE COMMISSION,

00:38:02.980 --> 00:38:04.660
COMMISSIONERS WOULD NOT BE ABLE
TO

00:38:04.660 --> 00:38:06.580
ACCEPT EMPLOYMENT FROM A
CANDIDATE

00:38:06.580 --> 00:38:09.100
FOR OFFICE OR AN ELECTED
OFFICIAL

00:38:09.100 --> 00:38:10.360
OF RIVERSIDE COUNTY.

00:38:10.360 --> 00:38:12.070
COMMISSIONERS WOULD ALSO BE

00:38:12.070 --> 00:38:13.600
PROHIBITED FROM RECEIVING

00:38:13.600 --> 00:38:17.230
NONCOMPETITIVE BID CONTRACTS
FROM RIVERSIDE COUNTY.

00:38:17.260 --> 00:38:19.570
FINALLY, WHILE SERVING ON THE
COMMISSION,

00:38:19.570 --> 00:38:20.680
COMMISSIONERS WILL BE BARRED

00:38:20.680 --> 00:38:22.390
FROM ENDORSING, WORKING FOR,

00:38:22.390 --> 00:38:24.850
OR MAKING FINANCIAL
CONTRIBUTIONS

00:38:24.850 --> 00:38:26.200
TO THE CAMPAIGN OF

00:38:26.200 --> 00:38:29.320
A CANDIDATE FOR ELECTED OFFICE
FOR RIVERSIDE COUNTY.

00:38:29.350 --> 00:38:32.320
THESE UPDATES WILL MAKE THE
REDISTRICTING PROCESS

00:38:32.320 --> 00:38:34.150
FOR THE BOARD OF SUPERVISORS
IN RIVERSIDE

00:38:34.150 --> 00:38:37.390
COUNTY FAIR MORE ACCESSIBLE AND
MORE TRANSPARENT,

