00:52:21.719 --> 00:52:23.280
FOR THE COSTS ASSOCIATED WITH

00:52:23.280 --> 00:52:24.690
THEIR HIGHER WATER USE.

00:52:24.900 --> 00:52:28.290
AB 1827 WILL BRING CLARITY TO
