SACRAMENTO, SAN DIEGO,

01:03:36.830 --> 01:03:39.170
BAY AREA, AND THE UNIFIED AIR
DISTRICTS.

01:03:39.170 --> 01:03:40.910
MOREOVER, THE BILL AUTHORIZES

01:03:40.940 --> 01:03:42.740
A YEARLY INCREASE IN
COMPENSATION

01:03:42.740 --> 01:03:46.010
NOT TO EXCEED EITHER $0.05 5%,

01:03:46.010 --> 01:03:48.740
OR INFLATION UP TO 10%.

01:03:48.950 --> 01:03:51.110
AIR DISTRICT BOARD MEMBERS ARE
DEDICATED

01:03:51.110 --> 01:03:52.730
PUBLIC SERVANTS ENTRUSTED WITH

01:03:52.730 --> 01:03:54.560
IMPROVING AIR QUALITY AND
ESTABLISHING

01:03:54.560 --> 01:03:56.480
EFFECTIVE CLEAN AIR PROGRAMS.

01:03:56.480 --> 01:03:58.850
DESPITE THEIR IMPORTANCE TO OUR
ENVIRONMENT.

01:03:58.850 --> 01:04:00.440
THE COMPENSATION LIMIT TO THE
BOARD

01:04:00.440 --> 01:04:03.710
MEMBERS WAS LAST SET IN THE
1980S.

01:04:03.710 --> 01:04:07.190
FOR EXAMPLE, COMPENSATION LIMITS
FOR SOUTH COAST

01:04:07.190 --> 01:04:12.290
AQMD WAS LAST AMENDED IN 1987
OR 37 YEARS AGO.

01:04:12.290 --> 01:04:13.940
AT THIS TIME, THE COMPENSATION

01:04:13.940 --> 01:04:16.580
LIMIT WAS SET AT $100 PER DAY,

01:04:16.580 --> 01:04:19.040
NOT EXCEEDING $1,000 PER MONTH.

01:04:19.040 --> 01:04:21.110
OVER TIME, THIS FIGURE HAS
DIMINISHED

01:04:21.110 --> 01:04:22.250
WITH INFLATION AND DOES

01:04:22.250 --> 01:04:24.050
NOT REFLECT THE PUBLIC SERVICE

01:04:24.050 --> 01:04:25.880
THESE BOARD MEMBERS PROVIDE.

01:04:25.880 --> 01:04:27.740
THIS BILL WOULD INCREASE THESE
FIGURES

01:04:27.740 --> 01:04:31.100
TO $200 A DAY, AT MOST $2,000
A MONTH,

01:04:31.100 --> 01:04:33.830
AND PROVIDE THAT THE BOARD MAY
FURTHER INCREASE

01:04:33.830 --> 01:04:37.490
COMPENSATION BY 5% OR INFLATION
UP TO 10%.

01:04:37.490 --> 01:04:38.690
LAST YEAR.

01:04:38.690 --> 01:04:42.110
SB 329 SIMILARLY INCREASED THE
COMPENSATION

01:04:42.110 --> 01:04:44.060
LIMITS FOR CITY COUNCIL MEMBERS.

01:04:44.060 --> 01:04:46.370
THIS BILL IS SPONSORED BY THE
SOUTH COAST

01:04:46.370 --> 01:04:47.840
