BUILDING OF THIS

01:26:03.350 --> 01:26:06.979
HOUSING IN AREAS THAT ARE ZONED
FOR AGRICULTURE.

01:26:06.979 --> 01:26:10.430
BUT AS WE AS WAS NOTED BY
ASSEMBLY MEMBER PELLERIN,

01:26:10.460 --> 01:26:13.130
THAT HOUSING HAS NOT BEEN BUILT
SIMPLY BECAUSE

01:26:13.130 --> 01:26:15.410
THOSE AREAS LACK THE
INFRASTRUCTURE,

01:26:15.410 --> 01:26:17.780
THE WATER, THE SEWER SYSTEM TO
ACTUALLY

01:26:17.780 --> 01:26:20.000
MAKE HOUSING AFFORDABLE.

01:26:20.000 --> 01:26:23.120
WHAT THIS DOES IS SIMPLY EXPANDS
THE GEOGRAPHIC

01:26:23.120 --> 01:26:27.920
AREA TO AREAS NEAR THE
AGRICULTURAL ZONES.

01:26:27.920 --> 01:26:30.710
SO THAT WE CAN ACTUALLY BUILD
HOUSING

01:26:30.710 --> 01:26:32.210
NOT ONLY THAT'S AFFORDABLE,

01:26:32.210 --> 01:26:33.860
BUT ON THE SCALE THAT IS NEEDED.

01:26:33.860 --> 01:26:35.420
IN SANTA CLARA COUNTY ALONE,

01:26:35.420 --> 01:26:37.400
WE NEED AT LEAST 700 UNITS

01:26:37.400 --> 01:26:39.830
TO HOUSE THE PEOPLE THAT PUT
FOOD ON THE TABLE.

01:26:39.830 --> 01:26:41.870
THE COUNTY HAS MADE AN
INVESTMENT.

01:26:41.870 --> 01:26:43.070
WE HAVE A MASTER PLAN.

01:26:43.070 --> 01:26:44.630
WE HAVE IDENTIFIED FUNDING,

01:26:44.630 --> 01:26:46.460
BUT WE NEED THIS EXPEDITED

01:26:46.460 --> 01:26:50.210
PROCESS SO THAT WE CAN FINALLY
BUILD THIS HOUSING.

01:26:50.210 --> 01:26:52.430
THIS IS A MODEST EFFORT THAT
WILL ALLOW

01:26:52.430 --> 01:26:54.380
SANTA CLARA AND SANTA CRUZ TO
BEGIN

01:26:54.380 --> 01:26:56.210
THIS PROCESS AND HOPEFULLY SHOW

01:26:56.210 --> 01:26:59.120
THE REST OF THE STATE HOW THIS
IS DONE.

01:26:59.330 --> 01:27:01.790
UH, SUPERVISOR SYLVIA ARENAS
HAS BEEN

01:27:01.790 --> 01:27:03.560
