01:30:05.770 --> 01:30:07.000
AND OUR INSURANCE COMMISSIONER,

01:30:07.000 --> 01:30:09.610
RICARDO LARA IN 1950.

01:30:09.640 --> 01:30:12.460
AB 1950 IS A CRITICAL STEP
FORWARD AND AIMS TO

01:30:12.460 --> 01:30:14.740
CORRECT AN INJUSTICE THAT
DISPLACED FAMILIES

01:30:14.740 --> 01:30:17.530
AND HAS LINGERED IN THE SHADOWS
OF LOS ANGELES

01:30:17.530 --> 01:30:19.750
EAST SIDE HISTORY FOR FAR TOO
LONG.

01:30:19.780 --> 01:30:21.520
AMID THE 1950S, THE VIBRANT

01:30:21.520 --> 01:30:22.780
COMMUNITIES OF PALO VERDE,

01:30:22.780 --> 01:30:25.600
LA LOMA AND BISHOP HOME TO
MOSTLY MEXICAN

01:30:25.600 --> 01:30:27.520
AMERICAN FAMILIES AS WELL AS
ITALIAN,

01:30:27.520 --> 01:30:29.320
AMERICAN AND CHINESE AMERICAN
FAMILIES,

01:30:29.320 --> 01:30:31.240
SAW AN UPHEAVAL AS FAMILIES

01:30:31.240 --> 01:30:34.120
WERE UPROOTED AND DISPLACED IN
THE NAME OF PROGRESS.

01:30:34.120 --> 01:30:37.000
FAMILIES WERE PROMISED A RETURN
TO BETTER HOUSING,

01:30:37.000 --> 01:30:39.280
BUT INSTEAD WERE LEFT DESTITUTE.

01:30:39.280 --> 01:30:40.689
DURING THIS TIME,

01:30:40.689 --> 01:30:43.510
THE CITY OF LOS ANGELES
UNDERVALUED

01:30:43.510 --> 01:30:45.490
THE PROPERTIES AND OFFERED

01:30:45.490 --> 01:30:47.500
VERY MINIMAL COMPENSATION,

01:30:47.860 --> 01:30:50.830
AND ALSO CALLED THESE
COMMUNITIES SLUMS.

01:30:50.830 --> 01:30:53.860
AND THEY WERE ACTUALLY VERY
VIBRANT COMMUNITIES WITH

01:30:53.860 --> 01:30:56.560
THEIR OWN PARKS AND SCHOOLS AND
SUPERMARKETS.

01:30:56.560 --> 01:30:58.240
ULTIMATELY, THE CITY ENDED

01:30:58.240 --> 01:31:00.520
UP USING EMINENT DOMAIN TO

01:31:00.520 --> 01:31:03.850
REMOVE THE REMAINING FAMILIES OF
THESE COMMUNITIES.

01:31:03.850 --> 01:31:05.979
FOR GENERATIONS, CHAVEZ RAVINE
STOOD AS

01:31:05.979 --> 01:31:08.800
A AS A BEACON OF HOPE AND
RESILIENCE,

01:31:08.800 --> 01:31:11.320
EMBODYING THE DREAMS AND
ASPIRATIONS OF FAMILIES

01:31:11.320 --> 01:31:13.330
WHO BUILT THEIR LIFE IN ITS
EMBRACE.

01:31:13.330 --> 01:31:16.030
WITH THIS LEGISLATION, WE ARE
ADDRESSING THE PAST,

01:31:16.030 --> 01:31:17.680
GIVING VOICE TO THIS INJUSTICE,

01:31:17.680 --> 01:31:20.470
ACKNOWLEDGING THE PAIN OF THESE
FAMILIES

01:31:20.470 --> 01:31:23.380
AND OFFERING POTENTIAL
COMPENSATION MEASURES,

01:31:23.380 --> 01:31:26.170
AND ENSURING THAT WE HONOR AND
REMEMBER

01:31:26.170 --> 01:31:27.820
THE LEGACY OF THESE FAMILIES

01:31:27.820 --> 01:31:29.410
AND THE COMMUNITIES OF PALO
VERDE,

01:31:29.410 --> 01:31:30.850
LA LOMA, AND BISHOP.

